{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2x6NxD2tbPQulJYtUnH7-Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:47.782012+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2x6NxD2tbPQulJYtUnH7-Q","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><span>为了促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流互动，西安交通大学电子与信息学部信息与通信工程学院（以下简称“信通学院”）将于</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>6~7</span></span><span>月举办全国优秀大学生夏令营，以增进全国优秀莘莘学子对我院的深度了解，诚挚邀请广大学子踊跃参加。</span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>一、活动时间和方式</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span><span>活动时间：</span></span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>6~7</span></span><span>月（具体时间另行通知）。</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span><span>活动方式：</span></span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>活动以线上为主，详情参见后续通知（请及时关注信通学院官方网站）。</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>二、活动内容</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、电信学部</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>信通学院概况介绍，教授专业解读、专家学术报告等，具体活动内容另行通知。</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、信通学院对营员进行综合素质、专业基础能力及发展潜力考核。</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>三、申请条件</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、申请者应是</span><span><span>2027</span></span><span>届应届本科毕业生。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、满足下列条件之一者优先考虑：</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）所在学校为一流大学建设高校；</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）所在专业在最新一轮学科评估中排名</span><span><span>B+</span></span><span>以上学科，综合成绩排名在专业前</span><span><span>15%</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>四、申请流程</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、网上申报时间：</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>-6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>15</span></span><span>日。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、学生填报：登录西安交通大学夏令营报名系统，（</span><span><span>http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/</span></span><span>），报名项目选择“全国优秀大学生夏令营”，注册获取报名号，用报名号登录系统，认真填写相关信息后保存、提交。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、材料上传：请申请者在网申系统提交以下申请材料的彩色扫描件，每人可选报</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>个专业：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学生证及身份证；</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）加盖申请人所在学校</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>院教务处公章的截止目前的本科正式成绩单；</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）英语四、六级证书；</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）在校期间，如获得过表彰奖励、发表学术论文、出版物或其它学术工作成果、社会实践鉴定等，请提供相应证明文件。</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>  </span></span><span>4</span></span></b></span></span></span><span><span><span><b><span><span>、审核录取：</span></span></b></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学院对申请者提交的材料及相关信息进行审核，确定审核通过者名单，并由学院统一发布信息，申请者可登陆网申系统查看申请状态，审核通过者，请尽快确认是否参加。请同时关注西安交通大学信通学院官方主页（</span><span><span>http://dice.xjtu.edu.cn/</span></span><span>）“通知公告”栏，重要信息将及时通过此公告栏发布。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span> </span></span><span>5</span></span></b></span></span></span><span><span><span><b><span><span>、学生确认：</span></span></b></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>入营学员需在报名端点击确认是否参加，逾期不确认者视为放弃，不再另行通知。</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span> </span></span></span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span><span>本办法解释权归信息与通信工程学院。</span></span></strong></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span> </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>联系方式：沈老师</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span> </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>咨询电话：</span><span><span>029-88968772</span></span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span> </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>官方网站：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>http://dice.xjtu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>信息与通信工程学院</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>28</span></span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"27a7d62aeadde45028184a7ffa9d042412a44a94d8718e2afb7f6adba665f128","textLength":916,"sourceSha256":"22a715d10c370722e3d8cde24581e845dd0bdb31d877bf88be20ca46e60d9e43","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-37bd0911b118ec2a0728","title":"2026年西安交通大学电子与信息学部信息与通信工程学院2026年（第七届）全国优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:47.782012+00:00"}
